Instructor: Assoc. Prof. Dr. Pham Cong Thang 

39 

_Hybrid Spatial-Frequency Learning with Block-wise DCT for Deepfake and Liveness Detection in eKYC_ 

still scores high accuracy. The thesis therefore adopts the area under the ROC curve at the frame level as the main metric, since it does not depend on the class ratio and measures the real-and-fake separability across all thresholds. 

