Instructor: Assoc. Prof. Dr. Pham Cong Thang 

54 

_Hybrid Spatial-Frequency Learning with Block-wise DCT for Deepfake and Liveness Detection in eKYC_ 

protocol, and although the full high-pass variant edges them at the frame level on this single seed, the paired interval contains zero, so no claim of a leaderboard win is made. The contribution is, first, a risk-safe fusion design with a floor guarantee; second, an improved high-pass variant that is the best measured member of the family; and third, a fair cross-dataset evaluation following a standard framework. 

